    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1:
1. Adaptation Taskforce strengthened, and ToR developed, with roles, responsibilities and coordination mechanisms determined.
2. RAN-API updated and validated, including approaches for institutional strengthening and cross-sectoral coordination, the establishment of an M&amp;E framework and an analysis of climate risk and vulnerability assessment indicators and impact assessment methodologies for adaptation options.

Outcome 2
1. SIDIK improved and indicators for climate risk and vulnerability developed.
2. Climate risk indicators/indices for the development of a RAN-API M&amp;E framework reviewed and determined and impact assessment methodologies for CCA options defined.

Outcome 3
1. Gender-responsive climate risk assessments conducted in Wakatobi utilizing a landscape-based adaptation approach 
2. Capacity of government staff in Wakatobi built on gender-responsive budget tagging for CCA and gender-responsive climate budget tagging guidelines developed.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is still accommodating input from stakeholders. It will be PAC in early 2023</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
